# Architecture

## Repo layout

Application and git repo share the same root:

```
./
  app.py                 # monolith: calc + UI + PDF + AI + org
  agents/                # thin LLM wrappers
  prompts/               # versioned prompt packs
  requirements.txt
  .streamlit/
  .venv/                 # local venv (gitignored)
  .cursor/               # agent rules, skills, commands
  docs/                  # steering & roadmap
```

## Suggested additive layout (new code only)

```
./
  reports/               # professional report builders (new)
  analysis/              # higher-level KP narrative helpers (new)
  schemas/               # typed chart/report payloads (new)
  tests/                 # golden chart fixtures (new)
```

## Key entry points in `app.py` (read-only reference)

| Function | Purpose |
|----------|---------|
| `calculate_comprehensive_chart` | Full KP chart dict |
| `get_sublord_kp_standard` | KP sublord from longitude |
| `compute_kp_significators` | House significations |
| `calculate_vimshottari_dasha` / `compute_antardashas` | Timing |
| `generate_pdf_report` / `generate_org_pdf_report` | PDF |
| `get_ai_reading` / `AGENTS` | Interactive AI readings |
| `_ai_pdf_summary` | Short PDF AI block |

## Stack

Streamlit UI · Swiss Ephemeris · geopy/timezonefinder · ReportLab · Pillow · OpenAI
